WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.524
Hi! I'm Mac the apple tree.

2
00:00:06.525 --> 00:00:09.909
I like spring because it's warm.

3
00:00:09.910 --> 00:00:15.245
I have new flowers and leaves.

4
00:00:15.246 --> 00:00:17.309
The bees visit me.

5
00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:23.145
Ahhh! Spring.

6
00:00:23.146 --> 00:00:26.279
I like summer because it's hot.

7
00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:28.637
My apples are big.

8
00:00:28.638 --> 00:00:34.076
My leaves are green.

9
00:00:34.077 --> 00:00:36.454
People have picnics.

10
00:00:36.455 --> 00:00:42.914
Hmmm! Summer.

11
00:00:42.915 --> 00:00:46.167
I like autumn because it's cool.

12
00:00:46.168 --> 00:00:48.700
My apples are red.

13
00:00:48.701 --> 00:00:54.081
My leaves are colorful.

14
00:00:54.082 --> 00:00:56.360
People pick apples.

15
00:00:56.361 --> 00:01:03.836
Wow! Autumn.

16
00:01:03.837 --> 00:01:07.131
I like winter because it's cold.

17
00:01:07.132 --> 00:01:09.506
My apples fall off.

18
00:01:09.507 --> 00:01:15.514
My leaves fall off.

19
00:01:15.515 --> 00:01:18.378
People make snowmen.

20
00:01:18.379 --> 00:01:23.835
Brrr! Winter.

